Shri Ram Parivar — third-party material

Font
- Uncial Antiqua by Astigmatic (Brian J. Bonislawsky), SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/uncialantiqua (licence in fonts/OFL-UncialAntiqua.txt)

Code
- lib.js and the glint/glow passes in film.js: the Gilded Illumination drawing kit from the Lemo-Opuscar style library
  (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT licence.

Sound
- All music and sound effects are synthesized in mix.py (Karplus-Strong harp, additive bells and organ, noise-based foley),
  using the library's sfx.py helpers. No samples, no recordings.

Pictures
- Everything on screen is drawn in code (film.js). No photographs, stock footage or generated images.
